# The pet: a shell line typed with the pet on, then the pointer sweeps the caret's row and the two
# above it, a press lands on the cat at rest and two beside it, the pointer leaves and typing
# resumes.

grid 16 80
style rainbow kitty
pet on 7
hz 60

at 0 pty "\e[9;1H$ "
at 700 key m
at 702 pty "m"
at 810 key a
at 812 pty "a"
